#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:51
msgid "Manage Rules"
msgstr "Manage Rules"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:52
msgid ""
"(Firewalls only) Users can create, edit, and delete individual rules "
"within existing firewall groups but cannot create or delete groups "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"(Firewalls solo) Usuarios puede crear, editar, y eliminar individual "
"reglas dentro de existente firewall groups pero cannot crear o eliminar "
"groups themselves."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:54
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Completo"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:55
msgid "Complete access including creation, editing, and deletion of resources."
msgstr "Completo acceso incluyendo creation, editing, y deletion de recursos."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:57
msgid "Group"
msgstr "Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:58
msgid ""
"(Routers only) Access is limited to routers within the user's assigned "
"Groups."
msgstr ""
"(Enrutadores solo) Acceso es limited a routers dentro de el usuario's "
"asignado Grupos."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:61
msgid "Configuring Security Roles"
msgstr "Configuring Security Roles"

